brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net my clumsy human fingers have too much trouble connecting the vertices. It needs a snap-to mechanism.

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@eternalism-when.bsky.social: I hiked a Eulerian tour of Wallington

I hated it 1 hour in and felt trapped in a nightmare by 2 hours; the unremitting 85F sun on nearly shadeless and totally soulless streets; knowing each ghastly intersection would recur

my most spiritually hateful hike to date -- a success!
